OL,3,GNEWSARed squirrel sightings on the rise
OL,4,Aafter storm
OL,5,
OL,6,FSightings of red squirrels have more
OL,7,Fthan doubled on an estate, five years
OL,8,Fafter their habitats were destroyed in
OL,9,FStorm Arwen.
OL,11,FThe population at Wallington, near
OL,12,FMorpeth, took a hit during the 2021
OL,13,Fstorm, with sightings rare for a number
OL,14,Fof years after.
OL,16,FBut rangers have recorded 37 individual
OL,17,Fsightings on the Northumberland estate
OL,18,Fso far in 2026, compared to just 16 for
OL,19,Fthe whole of 2025.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
